Technical Rationale:
This Type 4 pure Java JDBC driver enables Apache Hive 4.0.1 to communicate with
the MariaDB/MySQL relational metastore backend (`metastore_db`) on port 3306.
Checksum is recorded in resources/SHA256SUMS.
